":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117025","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117025.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117025.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-13T16:47:46Z"},"body":"Fixes #72639 \r\n\r\nThis PR fixes script classes not being recognised in imported resources (such as from custom EditorImportPlugin scripts) which is the root cause of them not showing up in the editor's quick load resource picker.\r\n\r\n\r\nPreviously the script class was never registered in the editor file system on first import (in `EditorFileSystem::_reimport_file`).\r\nIt also wouldn't get set correctly when refreshed (e.g. from `EditorFileSystem::update_file`) without the `ResourceFormatImporter::get_resource_script_class` method override to remap the original file path to its saved imported resource path.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117025/reactions","tot